    "- Loaded the supplied simplified XGBoost model and fitted preprocessing, predicted from the raw held-out inputs and reproduced all its test metrics. Maximum probability differences are below 3 × 10^-8, consistent with float precision in CSV storage. Discrete metrics and AUC match. This is inference verification, not a fresh rerun of Claude's entire search.",
    "- Reproduced the saved simplified Logistic Regression validation probabilities with negligible numerical error.",
    "- Refit preprocessing on reconstructed training inputs only. Its transformed values match the saved simplified preprocessing exactly. Saved numeric imputation medians match training medians.",
