    "The supplied preprocessing is saved with scikit-learn 1.9.1 and a pandas 3.x string dtype. Loading it under pandas 2.2.3 failed. An isolated verification environment with pandas 3.0.6 and scikit-learn 1.9.1 loaded it without version warnings. The JSON records the verification environment; it is not a recovered full freeze of Claude's original environment.", "",
    "### 6. Report the implemented preprocessing and previous test exposure", "",
